<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81230" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδείδῐα</span></b> , pf. in pres.
		sense, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			10.93
		</span></i>,al.; imper. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδείδιθι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίδεισα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>) always in forms with <i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίδϝεισαϝ,
			περιδϝείσασα</span>, etc. (v. infr.):—<i>to be in
				great fear</i> or <i>dread about</i>, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰνῶς γὰρ Δαναῶν π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.240
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>to be in great fear for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθήνη πᾶσι περιδείσασα θεοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.123
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἴαϝτι περιδείσαντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.822
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ῥα περίδεισαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.508
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμῇ κεφαλῇ περιδείδια, μή τι
					πάθῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.242
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδείσασ᾽ Ἀχιλῆϊ,
			μὴ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				21.328
			</span></i> : c. inf., <i>fear greatly</i> to do, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1203
			</span></i> : c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλέην περιδείδια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					51
				</span></i>
			.</div>
